    {
      "source": "When it is registered as Spring component its automatically invoked after object to <code>Document</code> conversion and\nbefore entities are saved to the database.",
      "translation": "当它被注册为 Spring 组件时，会在将对象转换为 `<code>Document</code>` 之后自动调用，并在实体保存到数据库之前执行。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The default value is <code>100</code>.",
      "translation": "默认值为<code>100</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Entity callback method invoked before a domain object is saved. Can return either the same or a modified instance\nof the domain object and can modify <code>Document</code> contents. This method is called after converting the\n<code>entity</code> to a <code>Document</code> so effectively the document is used as outcome of invoking this callback.\nChanges to the domain object are not taken into account for saving, only changes to the document. Only transient\nfields of the entity should be changed in this callback. To change persistent the entity before being converted,\nuse the <a href=\"BeforeConvertCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping.event\"><code>BeforeConvertCallback</code></a>.",
      "translation": "在保存域对象之前调用的实体回调方法。可以返回相同的或修改后的域对象实例，并且可以修改<code>Document</code>内容。此方法在将<code>entity</code>转换为<code>Document</code>之后被调用，因此实际上文档被视为调用此回调的结果。保存时不会考虑对域对象的更改，仅考虑对文档的更改。在此回调中应仅更改实体的瞬态字段。若要在使用转换之前更改持久化的实体，请使用<a href=\"BeforeConvertCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping.event\"><code>BeforeConvertCallback</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
